# Compiled executables only. Everything else — generated zig, gold chapters, the
# wasm module — is now tracked, per Steve 2026-08-29 ("just add everything for
# now; we can sort out gitignore in the next session").
#
# These four are left out because git keeps a blob FOREVER: they are 3.7 MB each,
